Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.29,0:02:28.71,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,160)\blur20\bord2\1a&HFF&}僕は　僕は　きっと　幸せものだ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.48,0:01:03.79,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(160,160)\blur20\bord2\1a&HFF&}我想要
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.79,0:01:06.84,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(160,160)\blur20\bord2\1a&HFF&}我想要见到你
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.27,0:01:23.14,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur20\bord2\1a&HFF&}假如能够  将你我二人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.14,0:01:27.23,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,160)\blur20\bord2\1a&HFF&}一加一融合成二  再对半分开
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.23,0:01:29.48,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(160,160)\blur20\bord2\1a&HFF&}假如有这样的魔法的话
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.48,0:01:32.53,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(160,0)\blur20\bord2\1a&HFF&}永不道别的  永恒便能到来了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.53,0:01:35.82,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur20\bord2\1a&HFF&}到明天  你不在我身边的话
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.82,0:01:38.87,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur20\bord2\1a&HFF&}我将会  悔到肝肠都寸断吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.87,0:01:41.99,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,160)\blur20\bord2\1a&HFF&}我那些  未讲出的字字句句
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.99,0:01:44.87,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(160,0)\blur20\bord2\1a&HFF&}都将会  让我如芒长在背吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.15,0:01:48.13,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(160,0)\blur20\bord2\1a&HFF&}到明天  你不在我身边的话
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.13,0:01:51.30,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,160)\blur20\bord2\1a&HFF&}我将会  变成何般的样子呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.30,0:01:54.47,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(160,160)\blur20\bord2\1a&HFF&}我每当  心中想起那些事来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.47,0:01:57.64,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(160,160)\blur20\bord2\1a&HFF&}就好想  下一秒就见到你呀
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.64,0:02:00.72,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(160,160)\blur20\bord2\1a&HFF&}等明天  还能和你共活的话
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.72,0:02:03.84,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(160,160)\blur20\bord2\1a&HFF&}我愿意  每天都是纪念日呀
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.84,0:02:06.98,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(160,160)\blur20\bord2\1a&HFF&}我愿意  将那些平凡的奇迹
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.98,0:02:10.19,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(160,0)\blur20\bord2\1a&HFF&}都永远  镌刻在我心头之上
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.19,0:02:13.30,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,160)\blur20\bord2\1a&HFF&}等明天  还能和你共活的话
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.30,0:02:16.39,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(160,160)\blur20\bord2\1a&HFF&}等明天  还能和你互语的话
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.39,0:02:19.20,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(160,0)\blur20\bord2\1a&HFF&}等明天  还能和你同笑的话
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.20,0:02:22.29,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur20\bord2\1a&HFF&}想着想着  就这样见到你了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.29,0:02:28.71,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,160)\blur20\bord2\1a&HFF&}你看我  你看我  已经无法更幸福了
Dialogue: 5,0:22:21.61,0:22:27.66,ED_JP,,0,0,40,,{\fad(240,240)\an8\blur5}Everything melts into the dead of night
Dialogue: 5,0:22:27.66,0:22:32.92,ED_JP,,0,700,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur5}As if even gravity fades away
Dialogue: 5,0:22:33.67,0:22:39.17,ED_JP,,700,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur5}Enchanted by the smile like a spark
Dialogue: 5,0:22:39.17,0:22:43.72,ED_JP,,700,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur5}「寂しい」忘れちゃう夜だ
Dialogue: 5,0:22:45.93,0:22:52.19,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur5}くだらなく愛おしい話を聞かせて
Dialogue: 5,0:22:52.77,0:22:54.60,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur5}Dance with me？
Dialogue: 5,0:22:54.60,0:22:58.78,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur5}二人で無限の闇を
Dialogue: 5,0:22:58.78,0:23:04.57,ED_JP,,0,0,40,,{\fad(240,240)\blur5}重ねた　手のひら　ぎゅっと結んで
Dialogue: 5,0:23:04.57,0:23:10.75,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur5}ぼやけた視界に映ったものは
Dialogue: 5,0:23:10.75,0:23:16.79,ED_JP,,0,0,20,,{\fad(240,240)\blur5}悲しいくらいに　美しいんだね
Dialogue: 5,0:23:16.79,0:23:20.92,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur5}彼方明けゆく空
Dialogue: 5,0:23:21.67,0:23:25.43,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur5}目を逸らすんだ
Dialogue: 5,0:23:31.68,0:23:38.57,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur5}Stay in night
Dialogue: 4,0:22:21.61,0:22:27.66,ED_CN,,0,0,115,,{\fad(240,240)\blur5}世间万物 融化夜色之中
Dialogue: 4,0:22:27.66,0:22:32.92,ED_CN,,700,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur5}仿佛重力 也随之消散
Dialogue: 4,0:22:33.67,0:22:39.17,ED_CN,,0,700,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur5}我已着迷 你笑容如火光
Dialogue: 4,0:22:39.17,0:22:43.72,ED_CN,,0,700,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur5}这一夜 我忘了何为寂寞
Dialogue: 4,0:22:45.93,0:22:52.19,ED_CN,,0,0,70,,{\fad(240,240)\an2\blur5}或是无聊 或催人眷恋 都对我尽情诉说吧
Dialogue: 4,0:22:52.77,0:22:54.60,ED_CN,,0,0,50,,{\fad(240,240)\blur5}与我共舞？
Dialogue: 4,0:22:54.60,0:22:58.78,ED_CN,,0,0,50,,{\fad(240,240)\blur5}你我两人 面对无尽的黑暗
Dialogue: 4,0:22:58.78,0:23:04.57,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur5}手拉着手 掌叠着掌 紧紧合为了一体
Dialogue: 4,0:23:04.57,0:23:10.75,ED_CN,,0,0,40,,{\fad(240,240)\blur5}逐渐模糊 的视野里 映射出来的那是
Dialogue: 4,0:23:10.75,0:23:16.79,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur5}那么悲伤 那么凄凉 但又那么美丽啊
Dialogue: 4,0:23:16.79,0:23:20.92,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur5}远方天边 正在泛红
Dialogue: 4,0:23:21.67,0:23:25.43,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur5}我却移开了目光
Dialogue: 4,0:23:31.68,0:23:38.57,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur5}不愿天明
